<title>BRAZIL: Brazil four-month insurance capitalization revs up.</title>
<headline>Brazil four-month insurance capitalization revs up.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian insurance industry saw its capitalization revenues increase 29.5 percent to 1.9 billion reais between January and April over the same period of 1996, said the National Federation of Insurance Firms (Fenaseg).</p>
<p>In the first four months of last year, capitalization market revenues totalled 1.4 billion reais, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
